  {
   "id": "starlight-legacy-277465@1.0.5",
   "gameId": "starlight-legacy-277465",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.5",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-13T02:26:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "CHANGES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) Battle animations will now always be on during the final battle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BUG FIXES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) Completing the bestiary should unlock the \"Monster Expert\" achievement... for real this time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Selecting an item in-battle and finishing the turn without using the item (such due to a status condition, or by winning the battle) will no longer consume the item.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "REMINDER",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As a reminder, the demo was updated in the previous update, and carrying over demo save files into the full verison of the game is now supported. Demo data from older demo versions (0.7.5 and below) will not carry over to v1.0.4 and above. However, if you follow the procedure below you can continue using older demo version save files in the v1.0.4 demo, but we cannot guarantee full compatibility with the full version of the game if you do this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) In file explorer, head to: \"C:\\Users\\yourname\\AppData\\Local\\pocket_rpg_demo\\\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Copy the \"starlight_legacy_saveX.save\" files to: \"C:\\Users\\yourname\\AppData\\Local\\pocket_rpg\\\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Rename the save files as \"file_demo0.save\", \"file_demo1.save\", etc. However, it is not recommended to do this and we recommend starting a new demo save in v1.0.4 instead to ensure full compatibility with the full version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
