  {
   "id": "starlight-legacy-277465@1.0.2",
   "gameId": "starlight-legacy-277465",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-09T03:19:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "CHANGES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) Items can be now be sorted by category by pressing the Start button in the inventory menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Items that cannot be used directly from the inventory screen are now greyed out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Expose magic's battle message now displays for several seconds, regardless of text speed setting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4) In battle, if a character is Stone or Frozen, they can no longer use Items nor the Throw command.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5) In battle, stat buff icons are now shown on the character portraits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6) The game will now check for the 'Monster Expert' achievement upon loading a save file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7) 'Movement' option has been added to the options menu. If set to 'Run', your character will run by default.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8) Menus that have a scrollbar can now be scrolled through by holding down one of the directional pad buttons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9) Edited the Stardust item's English description for clarity.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BUG FIXES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) Opening the item menu via the in-battle Throw command will now always show the main Items page (not the Key Items page).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Defeating the final boss should now trigger the 'Monster Expert' achievement if it's the last enemy that you've yet to encounter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Fixed an issue with the music not looping while looking through telescopes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "4) The game will no longer crash when using Summons on Steam Deck and/or 16:10 or 21:9 screen modes on PC.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
